  <Docs>
    <summary>Contains information about the optimizations performed on a DEX file.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>This information is intended only for debugging. It is not guaranteed to be stable across Android releases or devices.</para>
      <para>See the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/libcore/+/de876a01b29230b877c9f408348c38a90ee724a5/dalvik/src/main/java/dalvik/system/DexFile.java">Android DexFile.OptimizationInfo source</a></format>.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
