          <para>See the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/libcore/+/de876a01b29230b877c9f408348c38a90ee724a5/dalvik/src/main/java/dalvik/system/DexFile.java">Android isFullyCompiled source</a></format>.</para>
